": "WhatsApp Image 2026-07-09 at 16.42.14.png", "id": "890877673493455", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_890877676826788_2074757028307437770_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vIwmfujc_s8Q7kNvwErZZIC&_nc_oc=Adp3qg_uXk11keYjnF49XzAPNn-nG5hcE8dBr6Q_cn-GxmkngNu3gBPAImPHMgUxUng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKnSbMki0Kz4Z1cUNpPrqHIO7HgiyPRKGGdWTaSGMoD0g&oe=6AAE89A6"}, {"file_name": "WhatsApp Image 2026-07-09 at 16.47.59.png", "id": "1565966421863048", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_1565966425196381_1321511170835799879_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SZvD1pX07x8Q7kNvwEsAOzz&_nc_oc=AdqHRu6K1owtAwLIjoCrbe33ZQMRGs0_ToKl5ybhDjuJ52canQyL_Z-i4kvR1r2ceEE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJnWJ6W5M6nVtVs4EWzBc_6UQuKY1aqjkt2lX8tVRcsXA&oe=6AAEA823"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1trydigifuzzverse Mycosprint -upscaled - Copy.png", "id": "1523322072859836", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823837_1523322079526502_8525539049281311074_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lC0RhWdZHswQ7kNvwFIL-xI&_nc_oc=AdqNueAbbFymbo2BKulsJWWsHySIVyDqEfFrfPJH06Z8_9QWH5fyLxAGK9WUgap9lNM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJZuy7zwKT-3A2C7V_fuBocUSrUrAP9T-BWNrg9Tvvfug&oe=6AAE9A23"}, "display_name": "Myco Sprint XR", "keywords": ["mixedreality", "MRgame", "relaxinggame", "mushrooms", "naturegame"], "long_description": "MycoSprint is the world\u2019s first mixed\u2011reality mushroom cultivation learning agricultural game developed from Digi Fuzz Verse located in the food valley (Wageningen, Netherlands). Designed for intuitive play, it lets you grow real mushroom species inside your physical space using simple XR interactions. Insert mycelium seeds, adjust temperature, humidity, and light, and watch your mushrooms respond in real time. Each round teaches the core climate principles behind successful cultivation, turning complex biological concepts into hands\u2011on spatial learning. MycoSprint offers a calm, tactile, science\u2011driven experience that blends education with playful discovery, perfect for anyone curious about fungi, climate control, or mixed\u2011reality learning.", "short_description": "MycoSprint is the world\u2019s first mixed\u2011reality mushroom cultivation learning game developed from Digi Fuzz Verse located in the food valley (Wageningen, Netherlands). Grow real species in your own space and intuitively master the core climate principles: temperature, humidity, and light for optimal mushroom development. A fast, tactile XR experience that teaches the fundamentals of mycology through playful spatial interaction."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/DigiFuzzVerse/MycoSprint/blob/main/PRIVACY_POLICY.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://github.com/DigiFuzzVerse/MycoSprint/blob/main/TERMS_OF_SERVICE.md", "publisher_name": "DigiFuzzVerse", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/DigiFuzzVerse/MycoSprint", "website_url": "https://www.digifuzzverse.nl/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1318378781356499"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri":